---
description: Custody, authority, signing, admission, replay, and secret-handling rules.
globs: ["**/*auth*", "**/*delegat*", "**/*custody*", "**/*sign*", "**/*policy*", "**/*a2a*", "**/*mcp*"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Separate custody operations from delegated operational authority.
- Scope authority by subject, audience, methods/tools, value, time, nonce/JTI, and revocation.
- Enforce policy at the trusted service/contract boundary.
- Include replay, chain, audience, route, and signer-binding tests.
- Never weaken admission or call private routes to make an example pass.
